       "html": "<p><strong>Why:</strong> The calendar doesn&#39;t pause for research days — and today&#39;s synthesis may have just handed you a better post than the planned one.\n<strong>Where:</strong> Instagram (+ any second platform the plan names).\n<strong>Tools:</strong> Phone, your Day-7 week-2 content plan, <code>buzzend-marketing/16-templates/content-templates.md</code> (templates 5–6), <code>sprint/config.js</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Steps:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the week-2 plan and take today&#39;s slot: asset, platform(s), caption source.</li>\n<li>If Task 1 surfaced a burning question the planned post ignores, you may swap in a post that answers it — note the swap in the plan so the calendar stays true.</li>\n<li>Caption per templates 5 (Caption) and 6 (CTA picker); one CTA; store links from <code>sprint/config.js</code>, in bio.</li>\n<li>Publish at the planned time; stay online 30–60 min and reply to every early comment.</li>\n<li>Log the post URL in the tracker <code>Social</code> tab.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Deliverable:</strong> Week-2 post #2 live, URL in the <code>Social</code> tab.\n<strong>Done when:</strong> The post is up (planned or logged swap) and first-hour comments are answered.\n<strong>Depends on:</strong> —</p>\n"
