       "time": "45–60 min",
       "dep": null,
       "html": "<p><strong>Why:</strong> The first clip could arrive tonight. If the template exists, a raw user video becomes a publishable post in 20 minutes; if it doesn&#39;t, the clip sits in a DM losing momentum.\n<strong>Where:</strong> Canva.\n<strong>Tools:</strong> Canva, <code>brand/design-guide.md</code> (Energy Orange palette), <code>assets/screens-clean/</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Steps:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Create two linked templates: (a) a 1080×1350 quote card — big pull-quote area for the user&#39;s own words, first name + &quot;Buzzend user&quot; attribution line, Energy Orange accent from <code>brand/design-guide.md</code>; (b) a 1080×1920 video frame — space for the user&#39;s vertical clip with a slim branded header/footer so it reads as featured-by-us, not made-by-us.</li>\n<li>Put placeholder text in the quote slot (&quot;PASTE THEIR EXACT WORDS — never paraphrase a testimonial&quot;) so nobody forgets the rule.</li>\n<li>Use only <code>assets/screens-clean/</code> imagery for any app visuals — no raw device screenshots.</li>\n<li>Keep the user&#39;s footage area untouched by overlays — their counter moment is the proof; don&#39;t cover it.</li>\n<li>One CTA slot only (&quot;Try your first AI workout.&quot;). No banned words anywhere on the template.</li>\n<li>Save both in the shared Canva space named clearly (e.g. &quot;UGC quote card&quot; / &quot;UGC video frame&quot;) and drop the links in the tracker + team chat.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Deliverable:</strong> Two ready-to-fill testimonial templates, linked in the tracker.\n<strong>Done when:</strong> A test-fill with dummy text takes under 20 minutes start to export.\n<strong>Depends on:</strong> —</p>\n"
